# Tenancy (single-tenant default)

This template ships **single-tenant**: no organization context, middleware, or `organization_id` columns.

## Do not reintroduce lightly

```text
❌ organizations / organization_members tables or organization_id on core rows
❌ Org-scoped guards or request context without md/tenancy.md + forward migrations
❌ Fork-specific tenancy baked into @default/types without a documented decision
```

## When you need multi-tenant later

1. Update [`md/tenancy.md`](../../md/tenancy.md) with the chosen model (row-level vs schema-per-tenant).
2. Add migrations and shared types together; never half-add columns in Drizzle only.
3. Extend hygiene tests if new invariants apply.

Reference: [`md/tenancy.md`](../../md/tenancy.md).
